config BR2_PACKAGE_SHIM_SIGNED_BIN
	bool "shim-signed-bin (Microsoft-signed shim from Debian, for Secure Boot)"
	depends on BR2_x86_64
	help
	  The shim boot loader signed by Microsoft's UEFI CA (Debian's
	  shim-signed) and Debian's signed MOK Manager. With them the
	  MicroLinux GRUB and kernel, signed with the MicroLinux key, boot
	  with Secure Boot enabled once that key has been enrolled with MOK
	  Manager. The files are installed to images/shim/ for post-image.sh.
